Converted collection / auth.password [opencollection.yml]: the value is kept as the secret variable `basic_auth_password`, not in the file
Converted Inherited Folder / Own Auth / request.auth.password [Inherited Folder/Own Auth.yml]: the value is kept as the secret variable `own_auth_password`, not in the file
Converted Own Auth folder / auth.password [Own Auth folder/folder.yml]: the value is kept as the secret variable `own_auth_folder_password`, not in the file
Converted Own Auth folder / Own Auth / request.auth.password [Own Auth folder/Own Auth.yml]: the value is kept as the secret variable `own_auth_password_2`, not in the file
Converted No Auth / Own Auth / request.auth.password [No Auth/Own Auth.yml]: the value is kept as the secret variable `own_auth_password_3`, not in the file
Converted Own Auth / request.auth.password [Own Auth.yml]: the value is kept as the secret variable `own_auth_password_4`, not in the file
Converted collection [opencollection.yml]: `Environment` is the default environment because it holds the imported credentials
Converted imported credentials [environments/Environment.yml]: the imported credentials are the secret variables `basic_auth_password`, `own_auth_password`, `own_auth_folder_password`, `own_auth_password_2`, `own_auth_password_3`, `own_auth_password_4`; their values are kept in the secret store, not in the file
== Inherited Folder/Own Auth.yml
info:
  name: Own Auth
  type: http
  seq: 2

http:
  method: GET
  url: http://localhost:3000/health
  auth:
    type: basic
    username: john-custom-folder
    password: "{{own_auth_password}}"

settings:
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: inherit
  followRedirects: true
  maxRedirects: 5
  forwardAuthorizationHeader: false
